{"id":"e48b88ef54774547","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-tree9-rank-front.md","title":"ZFC Tree9 Rank Front","display":"df-zfc-tree9-rank-front — ZFC Tree9 Rank Front","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-tree9-rank-front","aliases":["58-df-zfc-tree9-rank-front"],"display":"df-zfc-tree9-rank-front — ZFC Tree9 Rank Front","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-tree9-front]]","[[58-df-ordinal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-tree9-rank-front"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-tree9-rank-front</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-tree9-rank-front — ZFC Tree9 Rank Front"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"dda7c85261e49800\" href=\"?note=dda7c85261e49800\" title=\"58-df-zfc-tree9-front\">58-df-zfc-tree9-front</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (ambient formal setting)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,F,T,s\\in V\">\\(\\alpha,F,T,s\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree9Front}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree9Front}_S\\)</span> (front predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"dda7c85261e49800\" href=\"?note=dda7c85261e49800\" title=\"58-df-zfc-tree9-front\">58-df-zfc-tree9-front</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}_S\\)</span> (ordinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree9RankFront}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree9RankFront}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (rank relation defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree9\\text{-}rank\\text{-}front} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree9RankFront}_S(\\alpha,F,T)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTree9Front}_S(F,T)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}_S(\\alpha)\\land\\alpha=\\bigcup\\{\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\cup\\{\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\}\\mid s\\in F\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree9\\text{-}rank\\text{-}front} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree9RankFront}_S(\\alpha,F,T)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTree9Front}_S(F,T)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}_S(\\alpha)\\land\\alpha=\\bigcup\\{\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\cup\\{\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\}\\mid s\\in F\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> is the least ordinal strictly above the lengths of every node in the front <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-tree9-front","status":"resolved","id":"dda7c85261e49800","anchor":"ref